title: Corrections
lede: Something wrong, missing or out of date? Here is how to tell us, and what happens next.
---
<p>Wrong or missing figure? Email <a href="mailto:{{ meta.corrections_email }}">{{ meta.corrections_email }}</a>
with the page or row, what is wrong, the correct value, and a <strong>source link</strong>. A
correction with no source to check it against can't be accepted.</p>

<p>Accepted corrections are committed within a week: one commit per correction, which also
bumps that row's checked date and, where the correction was checked against the primary source,
marks it verified. See <a href="/sources/">how this is compiled</a> for what verified and
unverified mean.</p>

<p>Your email is used only to check and answer the correction, and you are named only if you
ask. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a>.</p>
